@startuml CU-15
actor "Cliente" as Cli
boundary "«UI» Angular (carrito / mis reservas)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /cart, /reservations" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» CartService / ReservationService / Inventory" as Model

Cli -> UI : 1: agregar prendas al carrito
UI -> Ctrl : 2: POST /cart/items (varias variantes)
Ctrl -> Model : 3: add_item(db, cart, variant, qty)
Model --> Ctrl : 4: carrito + total
Ctrl --> UI : 5: CartRead
UI --> Cli : 6: carrito actualizado

Cli -> UI : 7: confirmar reserva
UI -> Ctrl : 8: POST /cart/checkout {branch_id}
Ctrl -> Model : 9: create(db, client, items)
Model --> Ctrl : 10: reserva PENDING + pickup_code
Ctrl -> Model : 11: clear(cart)
Ctrl --> UI : 12: ReservationRead
UI --> Cli : 13: código de recogida y vencimiento

Cli -> UI : 14: consultar mis reservas
UI -> Ctrl : 15: GET /reservations/me
Model --> Ctrl : 16: reservas del cliente
Ctrl --> UI : 17: ReservationRead[]
UI --> Cli : 18: listado de reservas

Cli -> UI : 19: cancelar reserva
UI -> Ctrl : 20: PATCH /reservations/{id}/status
Ctrl -> Model : 21: transition(CANCELLED) → libera stock
Model --> Ctrl : 22: reserva CANCELLED
Ctrl --> UI : 23: ReservationRead
UI --> Cli : 24: reserva cancelada

@enduml